[en.FOCUS_C12_ENLARGE_MILITARY_ORGANIZATION]
Enlarge military organization

[en.FOCUS_C12_ENLARGE_MILITARY_ORGANIZATION_desc]
The world situation is deteriorating rapidly, and we must be prepared to face potential wars at any moment. Every industry should contribute its strength to the rock farm’s military. This isn’t exploitation in disguise, but rather for the safety of all ponies.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_ENLARGE_MILITARY_ORGANIZATION]
扩大军事组织

[zh.FOCUS_C12_ENLARGE_MILITARY_ORGANIZATION_desc]
世界局势正在急速恶化，我们要随时应对好潜在的战争，各行各业都该为采石农场的军队贡献出自己的力量，这不是变相的压榨，而是为了所有小马的安危。

